# No Git LFS, for now. Re-add the filter lines in the same commit that installs git-lfs and
# runs `git lfs migrate import`, never before: a half-migrated repo (old PNGs plain, new PNGs
# pointers) is indistinguishable in a diff.
#
# DECISIONS #9 justified this on total asset weight, and that justification has expired --
# docs/ is now ~3.4 GB across ~5000 tracked screenshots against ~19 MB for src + public +
# assets combined, and a fresh clone pulls all of it. The reason to stay off LFS today is
# that migrating rewrites history; it is not that the repo is small.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.glb binary
*.bin binary
*.pdsts binary
